# Its optional search finds every matching Automatons in Bot1's library and reveals them (an Island is refused), while copies in hand and Bot2's library stay put.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Andromedan Automatons
Andromedan Automatons
Island x4
Andromedan Automatons
Andromedan Automatons
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x7
Andromedan Automatons
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Hand.Andromedan Automatons.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Accept
! Bot1.Search(Island)
Bot1.Search(Andromedan Automatons; Andromedan Automatons)

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 1
Bot1.Hand.Count = 7
Bot1.Hand.Andromedan Automatons#1.Power = 3
Bot1.Library.Count = 12
Bot2.Library.Count = 21
Bot1.Graveyard = Black Lotus
Bot1.Revealed = Andromedan Automatons; Andromedan Automatons
